Defense Warfare is now a hero defense! All previous mechanics remain the same, so the traps and towers are absolutely unchanged.

A lot of new mechanics have been added:

-Gunship - your Gunship is now the most essential element of the game. Use your customizable ability set and missile barrage to help your traps & towers fight against enemy vehicles;

-Gunship abilities - handpick your abilities to make your ability set unique and powerful;

-Vehicle attack - dodge incoming attacks from enemy vehicles if you want to stay in one piece;

It is recommended that old players revisit the tutorial if they want to avoid confusion.

